# State versus source.
#
# The crew's own state and MIRAI's state are not source: they change every hour and
# they can hold secrets. The dashboard file IS committed, because it is the product's
# own asset and replacing it should show up as a change.
data/*
!data/.gitkeep
!data/roles.json
*.log
*.err.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
dashboard.token
secrets.env
